{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../utilities/", "title": "Utilities"}, "next": {"link": "../cli/", "title": "CLI"}, "title": "Core", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"core\">\n<h1>Core<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#core\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.base\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-base\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.base<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.base\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClass\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.base.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseClass</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">config</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">plugin</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClass\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Base class providing core functionality.</p>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>Features:</dt><dd><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>Configured through a type-safe configuration object</p></li>\n<li><p>Built-in logging support</p></li>\n<li><p>Extensible through inheritance</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>config</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassConfig\"><em>BaseClassConfig</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>plugin</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassPlugin\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassPlugin\"><em>BaseClassPlugin</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClass.Config\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Config</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClass.Config\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>alias of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassConfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseClassConfig</span></code></a></p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClass.Plugin\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Plugin</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClass.Plugin\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>alias of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassPlugin\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassPlugin\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseClassPlugin</span></code></a></p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClass.start_time\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">start_time</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">float</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClass.start_time\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClass.setup_logger\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">setup_logger</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClass.setup_logger\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initialize the logger instance.</p>\n<p>The logger is configured using settings from config.logger_config.\nIf a logger is already set up, this method has no effect.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClass.validate_config\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">final</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">validate_config</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClass.validate_config\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>&#64;final</p>\n<p>Validates the configuration.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>This method is called during initialization to validate the configuration.\nIf the configuration is invalid, a <cite>ConfigValidationError</cite> is raised.\nIf the configuration has warnings, a <cite>ConfigValidationWarning</cite> is raised.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>Do not override this method. If you need to implement custom validation logic,\noverride the <cite>validate</cite> method in the <cite>Config</cite> class.</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ConfigValidationError\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ConfigValidationError\"><strong>ConfigValidationError</strong></a> \u2013 If the configuration is invalid.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ConfigValidationWarning\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ConfigValidationWarning\"><strong>ConfigValidationWarning</strong></a> \u2013 If the configuration has warnings.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.base.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseClassConfig</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">logger_config</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">validation_policy</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Base class for configuration settings.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>logger_config</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\"><em>LoggerConfig</em></a>) \u2013 Configuration for the logger component.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>validation_policy</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationPolicy\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationPolicy\"><em>ValidationPolicy</em></a>) \u2013 Policy for managing validation.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>logger_config</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\"><em>LoggerConfig</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>validation_policy</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationPolicy\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationPolicy\"><em>ValidationPolicy</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>Default configuration values are stored as class attributes. These defaults can be:\n- Overridden in derived classes\n- Modified through constructor arguments\n- Extended with additional user-defined attributes</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Examples</p>\n<p>Create a custom configuration by subclassing BaseClass.Config:</p>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">BaseClass</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">... </span>    <span class=\"n\">logger</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">LoggerConfig</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">level</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;DEBUG&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">default_config</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">custom_config</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">Config</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">logger</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">LoggerConfig</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">level</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;INFO&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig.logger_config\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">logger_config</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\"><span class=\"pre\">LoggerConfig</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">LoggerConfig(level='DEBUG',</span> <span class=\"pre\">filename='')</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig.logger_config\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig.validation_policy\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">validation_policy</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationPolicy\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationPolicy\"><span class=\"pre\">ValidationPolicy</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">&lt;PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationPolicy</span> <span class=\"pre\">object&gt;</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig.validation_policy\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig.validate\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">validate</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig.validate\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Override this method to implement custom validation logic in derived classes.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>List of validation results.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>List[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationResult\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationResult\">ValidationResult</a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig.to_dict\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">to_dict</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig.to_dict\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Convert the agent configuration to a dictionary.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>Dictionary representation of the agent configuration.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">dict</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassPlugin\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.base.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseClassPlugin</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassPlugin\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Base class for plugins.</p>\n<p>Can be used to store Plugin objects.</p>\n<p>This class automatically handles plugin attributes defined as class attributes\nand allows overriding them via constructor kwargs, eliminating the need for\nexplicit __init__ implementations in derived classes.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">MyPlugin</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">BaseClassPlugin</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"c1\"># Define default plugins as class attributes</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">zmq</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQPubSub</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">ZeroMQPubSub</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;tcp://*:5555&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">zmq</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">PUB</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">heartbeat</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">HeartbeatPlugin</span> <span class=\"o\">|</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Use defaults</span>\n<span class=\"n\">plugin1</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">MyPlugin</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Override specific plugins</span>\n<span class=\"n\">plugin2</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">MyPlugin</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">heartbeat</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">HeartbeatPlugin</span><span class=\"p\">())</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.base.exceptions\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-base-exceptions\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.base.exceptions<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.base.exceptions\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py exception\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.exceptions.TerminateProcess\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.base.exceptions.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">TerminateProcess</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">reason</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">''</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.exceptions.TerminateProcess\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/exceptions.html#Exception\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Exception</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Exception raised to signal the termination of a process with an optional reason.</p>\n<p>This custom exception can be used to gracefully terminate processes or threads,\nproviding a clear message indicating the reason for termination.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>reason</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py exception\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.exceptions.RecoverableException\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.base.exceptions.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">RecoverableException</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.exceptions.RecoverableException\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/exceptions.html#Exception\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Exception</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Exception raised to signal a recoverable error in an Agent.</p>\n<p>This custom exception can be used to signal that an error occurred during the execution\nof an Agent, but that the Agent can be recovered and resumed.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>message</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py exception\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.exceptions.NonRecoverableException\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">exception</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.base.exceptions.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">NonRecoverableException</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">message</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.exceptions.NonRecoverableException\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/exceptions.html#Exception\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Exception</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Exception raised to signal a non-recoverable error in an Agent.</p>\n<p>This custom exception can be used to signal that an error occurred during the execution\nof an Agent, and that the Agent cannot be recovered and should be stopped.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>message</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-base-utilities\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">LoggerConfig</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">level</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">'DEBUG'</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">filename</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">''</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Logger configuration class.</p>\n<p>This class defines the configuration settings for the logger component.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>If not specified, default values will be used.</p></li>\n<li><p>If not specified, the log file will be named like the Agent.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>level</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 Logging level. Defaults to DEBUG.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>filename</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>) \u2013 File name for logging. Defaults to empty string.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>level</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Literal\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Literal</em></a><em>[</em><em>'TRACE'</em><em>, </em><em>'DEBUG'</em><em>, </em><em>'INFO'</em><em>, </em><em>'SUCCESS'</em><em>, </em><em>'WARNING'</em><em>, </em><em>'ERROR'</em><em>, </em><em>'CRITICAL'</em><em>]</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>filename</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig.level\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">level</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/typing.html#typing.Literal\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">Literal</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"s\"><span class=\"pre\">'TRACE'</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\"><span class=\"pre\">'DEBUG'</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\"><span class=\"pre\">'INFO'</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\"><span class=\"pre\">'SUCCESS'</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\"><span class=\"pre\">'WARNING'</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\"><span class=\"pre\">'ERROR'</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\"><span class=\"pre\">'CRITICAL'</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'DEBUG'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig.level\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Logging level. Defaults to DEBUG.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig.filename\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">filename</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">''</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig.filename\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Log file name. Defaults to empty string.</p>\n<p>If not specified, the log file will be named like the Agent.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module I